# PHP / Symfony API

- PHP ≥ 8.5, Symfony 8.1 packages.
- Serializer groups: `Symfony\Component\Serializer\Attribute\Groups`.
- Login body: `{ "email", "password" }` → JWT in `data.jwt_token`.
- Register body: `firstname`, `email`, `password`, `repeatPassword`, `acceptPrivacyPolicy`.
- Mood aspects must match `MoodEntry::ASPECT_KEYS`; overall mood is `overallMood`, not an aspect key.
- Repositories extend `App\Repository\AbstractRepository`; UUID comparisons use `IDENTITY(...)` + `UuidType` when needed.
- `CustomJsonLoginAuthenticator` implements Symfony auth interfaces directly — do not extend final `JsonLoginAuthenticator`.
- Keep Nelmio CORS; do not restore broken `.htaccess` OPTIONS redirects.
- Avoid obsolete Doctrine config keys removed for SF8/DBAL4.
- PHPUnit: self-contained SQLite via `tests/bootstrap.php`; use `TestDatabase` for schema reset.
- Login throttling stays off in `APP_ENV=test`.
- Run tests with `php bin/phpunit` inside `mood_dic-php-1`.
